{"ref":"BDB, עֵילָם²","hw":"עֵילָם²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵילָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Ηλαμ, Αιλαμ:<br><strong>1.</strong>  heads of families of returned exiles: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:7\" href=\"/Ezra.2.7\">Ezr 2:7</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.12\">Ne 7:12</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:31\" href=\"/Ezra.2.31\">Ezr 2:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:33\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.33\">Ne 7:34</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:7\" href=\"/Ezra.8.7\">Ezr 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:2\" href=\"/Ezra.10.2\">10:2</a> (Qr; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">עולם</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:26\" href=\"/Ezra.10.26\">26</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a chief of people <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.15\">Ne 10:15</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  name in Benjamin <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.24\">1 Ch 8:24</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  Levite name <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.3\">1 Ch 26:3</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  a priest <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.42\">Ne 12:42</a>.","next":"BDB, עֲיָם","prev":"BDB, עֵילָם"}